<title>USA: Texaco reaches settlement in case - lawyer.</title>
<headline>Texaco reaches settlement in case - lawyer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Corp has settled a federal discrimination lawsuit filed by black employees, one of the lawyers for the plaintiffs said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have settled the case. We think it is precedent setting,&quot; said Attorney Daniel Berger.</p>
